Intel® Premier Support 

A Product Access Request (PAR) Line Item has been submitted to your Organization and requires Approval or Rejection by one of your Support Org Admins.

Approval Support Org: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Support_Org_Name__c}
PAR #: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_MAP_PAR__c}
Line Item #: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Name}
Line Item Approval Status: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Line_Item_Approval_Status__c}
Account: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Account__c}
Account Geo: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Account_Geo__c}
Account Sub Geo: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Account_Sub_Geo__c}
Supported Product: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Supported_Product_Name__c}
Submitter: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.CreatedBy}
Submitter Comments: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Submitter_Comments__c}

To Approve or Reject this PAR Line Item please go to the following link: {!$Label.Core_IPS_Notification_Internal_URL}/{!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Id}

If you would like to view a report of all pending PAR Line Items for your Org, please follow this link: {!$Label.Core_IPS_Pending_PAR_Report_URL}?pv1={!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Approving_Product_Organization__c}

NOTE: If a Product Access Request was submitted with multiple Line Items you will receive one email for each Line Item requiring approval.

